    "source_text": "Purpose: atomically create/replace one authorized file with path/type/size policy, explicit idempotency, and optional expected hash. Input: path:string, content:string, idempotency_key:string, encoding?:utf8|base64, expected_sha256?:string, create_only?:boolean. Output: normalized path, durable job_id, bytes, new sha256 and verification; status is available through mac_job_status. Contract: L2 writes_local; scope mac.files.write; target path; timeout 30000ms; cap 1MiB; network none; filesystem write_allowed_roots; secret zones denied; approval trusted_write; retries require the same idempotency key and a fresh bound approval; unresolved work is reported UNKNOWN_OUTCOME. Phase 3 planned."
